vents","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A pre-turn kill-switch or sign-in refusal could consume ready mail before the turn could run. Check the existing turn refusal before task-start mail consumption, preserving the first explicit recovery turn and exactly-once delivery. Update the app-server idle-eviction fixture to assert the exact plaintext inter-agent envelopes produced by its mock provider, including type, sender, target, contents and order.\n\nExact head `094454dd29bc7f85da92aa4a001b1e7fd0611db2`: glitch Rust1.99.1 app11/0, coreunit30/0, coreintegration82/1+1ignored. The sole failure is unchanged baseline `provider_throttle::named_accounts_on_one_key_share_a_cooldown`, selected by the broader named-account filter; all mail/refusal/wake cases pass. This clears one app-suite baseline failure. Changed-file formatting/diff/release-note checks pass.\n\nIndependent read-only Opus5.5High APPROVE, round3 under [explicit coordinator grant](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/pull/2458#issuecomment-6935329064). Round1 rejected a timing-only accommodation; the final fix preserves the original core recovery assertion and changes source admission ordering. Round2 approved source; granted round3 approved only the final envelope strings and passing evidence. No security-owned paths touched.\n\nAll 19 checks completed. All reds below are unchanged CLI #2274 sync-base failures: compilation at `cli/src/debug_sandbox.rs:450`, formatter conflict remnants in CLI, and the aggregate repo-checks failure. CLI files are unchanged. No pending checks.\n\n- [Build and package Corbanu Terminal](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43997454733/job/133752896457): CLI compilation failure (#2274).\n- [Linux credential canary](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43997461455/job/133753055084): CLI compilation failure (#2274).\n- [macOS credential canary](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43997461455/job/133753055354): CLI compilation failure (#2274).\n- [Windows credential canary](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43997461455/job/133753055445): CLI compilation failure (#2274).\n- [codex-core](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43997461424/job/133753177387): CLI compilation failure (#2274).\n- [codex-app-server](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43997461424/job/133753177097): CLI compilation failure (#2274).\n- [repo-checks / build-test](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43997461446/job/133752920463): CLI formatting/parse failure (#2274).\n- [CI required](https://github.com/CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal/actions/runs/43997461446/job/133754754141): aggregate repo-checks failure (#2274).\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-17T01:09:35Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T02:10:24Z","closed_at":"2026-11-17T02:10:24Z","merged_at":"2026-11-17T02:10:24Z","merge_commit_sha":"d7451716180d36109b5d8cd7ba9225952ea62890","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"CorbanuCore:work/astra-synccore6","ref":"work/astra-synccore6","repo":{"id":1283517261,"node_id":"R_kgDOTIDrTQ","name":"CorbanuTerminal","full_name":"CorbanuCore/CorbanuTerminal","owner":{"login":"CorbanuCore","id":315989408,"node_id":"O_kgDOEtWdoA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315989408?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore","html_url":"https://github.com/CorbanuCore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CorbanuCore/subscriptions","organizations